#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:5
#: 78986f976d794c3982b949de029ad3f9
msgid "Calibration: Compass Calibration"
msgstr "校准：罗盘校准"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:7
#: 19828ca318b94f5c912ff69c891a5e6b
msgid ""
"This article explains how to use APM Planner to calibrate your autopilot's "
"compass to work with your vehicle configuration. For other calibration tasks"
" see :ref:`Autopilot calibration <autopilot-calibration>`."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何使用 APM Planner 校准飞控的罗盘，以适配您的飞行器配置。有关其他校准任务，请参阅 :ref:`飞控校准 <autopilot-"
"calibration>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:12
#: 99181b2af23b416e8dc0cd114024f7c6
msgid "1 Prerequisites"
msgstr "1 前提条件"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:14
#: 390904c190fe4299ae5fad1a23742d26
msgid "Before performing setup, ensure that:"
msgstr "在执行设置之前，请确保："

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:16
#: 6f4a88df71d846f285c46bbb74659da1
msgid "The vehicle is completely built to flight condition."
msgstr "飞行器已完整组装至可飞行状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:17
#: ef4bf6b516e344a3ad5304a30a6f5db3
msgid ":ref:`Firmware has been loaded onto the autopilot. <install-firmware>`"
msgstr ":ref:`固件已加载到飞控中。 <install-firmware>`"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:18
#: e96a3916a32a467dabf0258db72fa733
msgid ":ref:`Autopilot is connected to APM Planner. <connect-autopilot>`"
msgstr ":ref:`飞控已连接至 APM Planner。 <connect-autopilot>`"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:21
#: a443bd060e484eb7a47b8cfab1180342
msgid "2 Select option"
msgstr "2 选择选项"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:23
#: f3c8b7e3d10c489f8fbd10002c43c5b5
msgid ""
"Under **Orientation**, **select your autopilot** configuration: Pixhawk, APM"
" 2.5 and earlier, or APM 2.6 with 3DR GPS+Compass. Ensure that the option to"
" **Enable the compass** and **allow Auto Declination** are selected as shown"
" below."
msgstr ""
"在「Orientation」（方向）下，**选择您的飞控** 配置：Pixhawk、APM 2.5 及更早版本，或带 3DR GPS+罗盘的 APM "
"2.6。确保已勾选「Enable the compass」（启用罗盘）和「allow Auto "
"Declination」（允许自动磁偏角）选项，如下所示。"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:31
#: e231e7e80e594bf79ceec02e88daccec
msgid ""
"To perform **manual declination**, follow the link to the **Declination "
"Website**. Find the two numbers listed as the **Magnetic Declination** and "
"input the first number in the **Degrees** field and the second number in the"
" **Minutes** field."
msgstr ""
"如需 **手动设置磁偏角**，请点击链接进入 **磁偏角网站**。找到标注为「Magnetic "
"Declination」（磁偏角）的两个数字，将第一个数字输入「Degrees」（度）字段，将第二个数字输入「Minutes」（分）字段。"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:37
#: ada1ff2109ff46adb72f7d7f397a8b66
msgid "3 Calibrate"
msgstr "3 校准"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:39
#: 7ec84dc7ee4b4b2fa81502a9b90a74c0
msgid ""
"Select **Live Calibration** to begin calibration. APM Planner will start a "
"timer. During these next 60 seconds, hold your vehicle in the air and rotate"
" it slowly so that each side (front, back, left, right, top and bottom) "
"points down towards the earth for a few seconds in turn. `Check out this "
"video <https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmsueBS0J3E>`__ for a demonstration "
"of how to calibrate the compass."
msgstr ""
"选择「Live Calibration」开始校准。APM Planner 将启动计时器。在接下来的 60 "
"秒内，将飞行器举在空中并缓慢旋转，使每个面（前、后、左、右、顶部和底部）依次朝向地面几秒钟。`观看此视频 "
"<https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DmsueBS0J3E>`__ 了解罗盘校准的演示方法。"

#: ../../source/docs/compass-calibration.rst:45
#: c65f389fc83846ce8f558146af765b95
msgid ""
"When the calibration period ends, APM Planner will display the resulting "
"offsets. For APM, all three values should be between -150 and 150. For PX4 "
"and Pixhawk, values may be greater than 150 and less than -150."
msgstr ""
"校准结束后，APM Planner 将显示校准偏移量结果。对于 APM，三个值均应在 -150 至 150 之间。对于 PX4 和 "
"Pixhawk，数值可能大于 150 或小于 -150。"

